    citations:
    - claim: Comparative errors point to direct translation from M/I (as...instead of -er than)
      source: Swan & Smith (2001) Learner English, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press
      location: Malay/Indonesian speakers, p. 290
      tier: 1
    - claim: M/I uses 'lebih' and 'paling' rather than -er/-est suffixes
      source: Swan & Smith (2001) Learner English, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press
