    - claim: M/I learners have problems distinguishing English word pairs with single M/I equivalent
      source: Swan & Smith (2001) Learner English, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press
      location: Malay/Indonesian speakers, p. 291
      tier: 1
    - claim: Lexical transfer from English to M/I involves loanwords with different spellings (talipon, ekonomi)
      source: Swan & Smith (2001) Learner English, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press
